state can't be read from the version one

7
00:00:20.712 --> 00:00:23.699
point oh A P I, so the next
module asks a person to

8
00:00:23.699 --> 00:00:27.000
state that the gate is On
before it sets the context.

9
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.400
Next is Module 4: PIM for
Microsoft Entra roles as code.

10
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:34.707
You hold each role's PIM
settings as one reviewed file,

11
